# Affiliate exports (client's tracked links — imported via /admin/aliexpress,
# not source code). Keep the folder locally, out of the repo.
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo root: a bare `products/` would also
# swallow app/pages/products/ and server/api/products/.
/products/


